{"unit_id":"VioletScar-Hui__dsh-chat-history#feature-1","repo":"VioletScar-Hui/dsh-chat-history","commit":"232d7244cfe25e4838036018c92f4c02c672b90b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-history 的功能「上下键浏览消息」：在 DSH 网页聊天输入框将光标置于行首后按 ↑，可向前浏览历史；按 ↓ 可继续前进并在末尾恢复原草稿。输入法合成或非普通输入阶段不会触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:96-148"]}
